oduce a lot of emissions.","example_es":"Le auto producono molte emissioni.","difficulty":1,"tags":["environment"]},{"id":"eit-carbon-footprint","language_code":"en","unit_id":"eit-b2-u07","text":"carbon footprint","translation_es":"impronta di carbonio","accepted_translations":["l’impronta di carbonio","impronta ecologica"],"ipa":"/ˈkɑrbən ˈfʊtˌprɪnt/","romanization":null,"emoji":"👣","example_en":"Eating less meat reduces your carbon footprint.","example_es":"Mangiare meno carne riduce la tua impronta di carbonio.","difficulty":1,"tags":["environment","collocations"]},{"id":"eit-consequence","language_code":"en","unit_id":"eit-b2-u07","text":"consequence","translation_es":"conseguenza","accepted_translations":["la conseguenza"],"ipa":"/ˈkɑnsəˌkwɛns/","romanization":null,"emoji":null,"example_en":"Floods are a consequence of global warming.","example_es":"Le alluvioni sono una conseguenza del riscaldamento globale.","difficulty":1,"tags":["environment","connectors"]},{"id":"eit-drought","language_code":"en","unit_id":"eit-b2-u07","text":"drought","translation_es":"siccità","accepted_translations":["la siccità"],"ipa":"/draʊt/","romanization":null,"emoji":"🏜️","example_en":"It is the worst drought in fifty years.","example_es":"È la peggiore siccità degli ultimi cinquant’anni.","difficulty":1,"tags":["environment","weather"]},{"id":"eit-flood","language_code":"en","unit_id":"eit-b2-u07","text":"flood","translation_es":"alluvione / inondazione","accepted_translations":["inondazione","alluvione","l’alluvione","l’inondazione"],"ipa":"/flʌd/","romanization":null,"emoji":"🌊","example_en":"The flood destroyed many homes.","example_es":"L’alluvione ha distrutto molte case.","difficulty":1,"tags":["environment","weather"]},{"id":"eit-shortage","language_code":"en","unit_id":"eit-b2-u07","text":"shortage","translation_es":"scarsità / carenza","accepted_translations":["scarsità","carenza","mancanza","penuria","la carenza","la scarsità"],"ipa":"/ˈʃɔrtɪdʒ/","romanization":null,"