this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"Che cosa spiega Nina sulla sua email?","options":["Che non voleva sembrare arrabbiata: aveva fretta","Che era arrabbiata con Mark","Che non l’aveva scritta lei","Che l’aveva mandata per sbaglio"]},"answer":"Che non voleva sembrare arrabbiata: aveva fretta","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nina dice: “I didn’t mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that’s all”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u01-l05-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u01-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"His body language showed that he was nervous.","options":["His body language showed that he was nervous.","His body language showed that he was angry.","Her body language showed that she was nervous.","His tone showed that he was nervous."]},"answer":"His body language showed that he was nervous.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-body-language"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u01-l05-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u01-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["People","tend","to","look","away","when","they","are","lying"],"translation":"Le persone tendono a distogliere lo sguardo quando mentono."},"answer":"People tend to look away when they are lying.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-tend-to","eit-body-languag