 priority. The budget is”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l01-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u2-supplier","setting":"Una manager tratta con un fornitore il prezzo e la data di consegna.","speakers":[{"name":"Rachel","voice":"a"},{"name":"Daniel","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Thanks for the proposal, Daniel. To be honest, the price is higher than we expected."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"I understand. What if we kept the price but delivered two weeks earlier?"},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Time is not our main priority. The budget is. Could you go down five percent?"},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"Five is difficult. I could offer three, as long as you sign a two-year contract."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Two years is a long time. Let's meet halfway: four percent and an eighteen-month contract."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"That sounds fair. Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Great. Please send me the new terms in writing."}]},"question":"Come finisce la trattativa?","options":["Con un accordo, a condizione che il direttore di Daniel sia d’accordo","Senza accordo","Con un contratto firmato quel giorno stesso","Con una nuova riunione"]},"answer":"Con un accordo, a condizione che il direttore di Daniel sia d’accordo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Daniel dice: “Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l01-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We need to negotiate a better price.","options":["We need to negotiate a better price.","We need to negotiate 