":"Daniel","text":"I understand. What if we kept the price but delivered two weeks earlier?"},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Time is not our main priority. The budget is. Could you go down five percent?"},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"Five is difficult. I could offer three, as long as you sign a two-year contract."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Two years is a long time. Let's meet halfway: four percent and an eighteen-month contract."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"That sounds fair. Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Great. Please send me the new terms in writing."}]},"question":"Come finiscono per venirsi incontro?","options":["Uno sconto del quattro per cento e un contratto di diciotto mesi","Il cinque per cento e due anni","Il tre per cento e un anno","Nessuno sconto e consegna anticipata"]},"answer":"Uno sconto del quattro per cento e un contratto di diciotto mesi","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rachel propone: “Let’s meet halfway: four percent and an eighteen-month contract”, e Daniel accetta.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l02-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l02","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Our main priority is the customer.","options":["Our main priority is the customer.","Our main priority is the budget.","Our first priority is the customer.","Your main priority is the customer."]},"answer":"Our main priority is the customer.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-priority"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l02-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l02","position":6,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["My","boss","is","flexible","about","working","hours"],"translation":"Il mio capo è flessibile sugli orari di lavoro."},"answer