,"sentence":"I'm ___ I'll have to turn it down.","translation":"Temo che dovrò rifiutare.","options":["afraid","sorry","scared","worried"]},"answer":"afraid","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"I’m afraid… ammorbidisce una brutta notizia (temo che).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-turn-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u2-team","setting":"Una team leader parla con un dipendente sommerso di lavoro.","speakers":[{"name":"Grace","voice":"a"},{"name":"Omar","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Grace","text":"Omar, you look exhausted. Is your workload too heavy at the moment?"},{"speaker":"Omar","text":"Honestly, yes. I took on the new client last month, and I'm still doing my old projects."},{"speaker":"Grace","text":"You should have told me. A good leader needs to know these things."},{"speaker":"Omar","text":"I didn't want to turn down the client. I thought it was a good opportunity."},{"speaker":"Grace","text":"It is, but you can't do everything. Let's delegate the reports to Ben."},{"speaker":"Omar","text":"Are you sure? He is quite new."},{"speaker":"Grace","text":"That's fine. I'll help him at the beginning, in case he has questions."}]},"question":"Perché Omar non ha rifiutato il cliente nuovo?","options":["Perché gli è sembrata una buona occasione","Perché gliel’ha ordinato Grace","Perché aveva bisogno di uno stipendio più alto","Perché Ben non poteva"]},"answer":"Perché gli è sembrata una buona occasione","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Omar dice: “I didn’t want to turn down the client. I thought it was a good opportunity”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u2-offer","document":"email","setting":"Una candidata risponde a un’offerta di lavoro.","from":"Laura Kim","to":"Mr. Patel","title":"Job offer","lines":["Dear Mr. Patel,","Thank you very much for the job offer. I am very excited about joining the team.","Before I accept, I would like to discuss one point. In my current job I work from home two days a week, and this flexibility is important to me.","I would be happy to accept a slightly lower salary, provided that I can keep those two days at home. Otherwise, I am afraid I would have to turn the offer down.","I hope we can reach an agreement. I am free to talk at any time this week.","Kind regards,","Laura Kim"]},"question":"Che tono ha l’email di Laura?","options":["Gentile e aperto alla trattativa","Arrabbiato ed esigente","Triste e rassegnato","Informale e spiritoso"]},"answer":"Gentile e aperto alla trattativa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Laura ringrazia per l’offerta, spiega la sua condizione e chiude con “I hope we can reach an agreement”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I'm afraid I'll have to turn it down.","options":["I'm afraid I'll have to turn it down.","I'm afraid I'll have to take it on.","I'm sure I'll have to turn it down.","I'm afraid I had to turn it down."]},"answer":"I'm afraid I'll have to turn it down.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-turn-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","turned","down","the","offer","because","of","the","hours"],"translation":"Ha rifiutato l’offerta per via degli orari."},"answer":"She turned down the offer because of the hours.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-turn-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Did you accept the job? (no, l’hai rifiutato perché lo stipendio era basso)","translation":"Hai accettato il lavoro?"},"answer":"No, I turned it down because the salary was low.","accepted_answers":["No, I turned it down.","No, I turned it down because the salary was too low.","I turned it down because the salary was low."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-turn-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-l05-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-l05","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Ti aiuterò, a condizione che tu me lo dica prima."},"answer":"I will help you, provided that you tell me before.","accepted_answers":["I'll help you, provided that you tell me before.","I will help you provided that you tell me before.","I'll help you provided that you tell me first.","I will help you, provided that you tell me first."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-provided-that"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-listen-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-listen","position":1,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"turn down","options":["turn down","priority","delegate","deal"]},"answer":"turn down","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-turn-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u02-listen-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u02-listen","position":2,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es"