"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"Com’è nata l’idea del filtro?","options":["Per caso, da un esperimento fallito","Dopo anni di pianificazione","Grazie a un altro scienziato","Durante un viaggio in un villaggio"]},"answer":"Per caso, da un esperimento fallito","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dice: “By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed… But the results showed something we didn’t expect”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l01-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u4-interview","setting":"Un’intervista alla radio a una scienziata che ha inventato un filtro per l’acqua.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mei","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"Che prove hanno che il filtro funziona fuori dal laboratorio?","options":["L’hanno provato in quaranta villaggi e i dati sono chiari","Ancora nessuna","L’hanno provato nella loro città","Lo usano negli ospedali"]},"answer":"L’hanno provato in quaranta villaggi e i dati sono chiari","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dice: “We have tested it in forty villages… The data are very clear”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l01-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","options":["The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","The experiment worked, and we learned a lot.","The experiment failed, but we learned nothing.","The experiments failed, but we learned a lot."]},"answer":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-experiment"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l01-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","is","a","scientist","who","studies","the","ocean"],"translation":"È una scienziata che studia l’oceano."},"answer":"She is a scientist who studies the ocean.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-scientist"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l01-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l01","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Does this medicine really work? (non ci sono prove)","translation":"Questo medicinale funziona davvero?"},"answer":"There is no evidence that it works.","accepted_answers":["There's no evidence that it works.","There is no evidence.","There's no evidence."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-evidence"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l01-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l01","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"L’esperimento è fallito, ma abbiamo imparato molto."},"answer":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","accepted_answers":["The experiment failed but we learned a lot.","The experiment failed, but we learnt a lot."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-experiment"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l02-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l02","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"breakthrough","right":"svolta / grande passo avanti"},{"left":"invention","right":"invenzione"},{"left":"innovation","right":"innovazione"},{"left":"come up with","right":"farsi venire in mente / ideare"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-breakthrough","eit-invention","eit-innovation","eit-come-up-with"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l02-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l02","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Compl