"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Dani","text":"Grandma, your phone is so outdated. It is older than me!"},{"speaker":"Grandma","text":"It works fine, thank you. It makes calls, which is all I need."},{"speaker":"Dani","text":"But you can't use video calls, and the bank app doesn't work on it."},{"speaker":"Grandma","text":"I know. It's hard to keep up with technology. Everything changes so fast."},{"speaker":"Dani","text":"I'll help you. My old phone, which I don't use anymore, is much newer than yours."},{"speaker":"Grandma","text":"Is it one of those cutting-edge phones with three cameras?"},{"speaker":"Dani","text":"Not really, but it's good enough for you. And I'll teach you how to use it."}]},"question":"Che cosa offre Dani alla nonna?","options":["Il suo vecchio telefono, che è molto più nuovo, e insegnarle a usarlo","Un telefono di ultima generazione","Comprarle un telefono","Aggiustarle il telefono"]},"answer":"Il suo vecchio telefono, che è molto più nuovo, e insegnarle a usarlo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dani dice: “My old phone, which I don’t use anymore, is much newer than yours… And I’ll teach you how to use it”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l05-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l05","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"It's hard to keep up with technology.","options":["It's hard to keep up with technology.","It's easy to keep up with technology.","It's hard to keep up with the news.","It was hard to keep up with technology."]},"answer":"It's hard to keep up with technology.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-keep-up-with"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u04-l05-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u04-l05","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["My","