:"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"cut back on","right":"spendere meno per / tagliare"},{"left":"subscription","right":"abbonamento"},{"left":"second-hand","right":"di seconda mano / usato"},{"left":"bargain","right":"affare / occasione"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-cut-back-on","eit-subscription","eit-second-hand","eit-bargain"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l02-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l02","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"We need to cut back ___ eating out.","translation":"Dobbiamo tagliare le spese per mangiare fuori.","options":["on","in","of","at"]},"answer":"on","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-cut-back-on"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l02-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l02","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Thirty dollars? That is a real ___!","translation":"Trenta dollari? È un vero affare!","options":["bargain","debt","loan","price"]},"answer":"bargain","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-bargain"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l02-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l02","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Un post di un blog su come risparmiare.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Second, I started buying second-hand clothes and furniture. Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"Che cosa ha fatto per prima cosa l’autrice per risparmiare?","options":["Disdire gli abbonamenti che non usava","Chiedere un prestito","Cambiare lavoro","Vendere la macchina"]},"answer":"Disdire gli abbonamenti che non usava","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Scrive: “First, I cut back on subscriptions… Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l02-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Un post di un blog su come risparmiare.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Second, I started buying second-hand clothes and furniture. Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"Che cosa si chiede prima di comprare qualcosa?","options":["Se vale quello che costa o se lo vuole e basta","Se è di una buona marca","Se può pagarlo a rate","Se è di moda"]},"answer":"Se vale quello che costa o se lo vuole e basta","accepted_answers":[],"explanation