 back on","options":["spendere meno per / tagliare","affare / occasione","risparmi","di gran lunga / nettamente"]},"answer":"spendere meno per / tagliare","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["eit-cut-back-on"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":1,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I had my phone ___ last week.","translation":"La settimana scorsa mi sono fatto riparare il telefono.","options":["repaired","repair","repairing","to repair"]},"answer":"repaired","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Have + oggetto + participio (repaired).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-have-something-done"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I'm going to get my hair ___ tomorrow.","translation":"Domani vado a farmi tagliare i capelli.","options":["cut","cutting","to cut","cuts"]},"answer":"cut","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Cut è irregolare: il participio è cut.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-have-something-done"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"We are having our kitchen ___ next month.","translation":"Il mese prossimo ci facciamo imbiancare la cucina.","options":["painted","paint","painting","to paint"]},"answer":"painted","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-have-something-done"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u5-repair","setting":"Un cliente in un negozio che ripara telefoni.","speakers":[{"name":"Customer","voice":"a"},{"name":"Assistant","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hi. I dropped my phone yesterday and I'd like to have the screen replaced."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Let me see. Yes, we can do that. It's ninety dollars, and it'll be ready tomorrow."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Ninety? That's twice as much as I paid last time!"},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Last time you had a cheaper screen put in. This one is original. The cheaper ones are nowhere near as good."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hmm. Is it worth it? The phone is three years old."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Honestly, the older the phone, the less sense it makes. A new one costs about four hundred."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"I can't afford a new one right now. Go ahead and replace the screen, please."}]},"question":"Che cosa vuole il cliente?","options":["Farsi cambiare lo schermo del telefono","Di comprare un telefono nuovo","Farsi restituire i soldi","Riparare lo schermo da solo"]},"answer":"Farsi cambiare lo schermo del telefono","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Il cliente dice: “I’d like to have the screen replaced”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u5-flatmates","setting":"Due amici che dividono l’appartamento parlano di soldi.","speakers":[{"name":"Jake","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rita","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Jake","text":"I'm thinking of taking out a loan to buy a car."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Are you sure? You still have debt on your credit card."},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"I know, but the bank is offering a low interest rate at the moment."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Low now, but it could rise. And can you really afford the monthly payments?"},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"If I cut back on eating out, I think so."},{"speaker":"Rita","text":"Why not buy a second-hand car instead? You'd need a much smaller loan, or no loan at all."},{"speaker":"Jake","text":"That's actually a good idea. I'll have a mechanic check a few cars this weekend."}]},"question":"Che cosa farà Jake questo fine settimana?","options":["Far controllare alcune auto da un meccanico","Controllare lui stesso le auto","Chiedere il prestito","Vendere la macchina"]},"answer":"Far controllare alcune auto da un meccanico","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Jake dice: “I’ll have a mechanic check a few cars this weekend”. Have + persona + verbo: lo fa un’altra persona.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I had my phone repaired last week.","options":["I had my phone repaired last week.","I repaired my phone last week.","I had my phone repaired last month.","I have my phone repaired every year."]},"answer":"I had my phone repaired last week.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-have-something-done"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","would","like","to","have","the","screen","replaced"],"translation":"Vorrei far cambiare lo schermo."},"answer":"I would like to have the screen replaced.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-have-something-done","eit-replace"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u05-l03-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u05-l03","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_buildi