01-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u06-l01","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"She ___ have forgotten. I reminded her this morning.","translation":"Non può essersene dimenticata. Gliel’ho ricordato stamattina.","options":["can't","must","should","might"]},"answer":"can't","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Can’t have: sei quasi sicuro che non sia successo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-cant-have"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u06-l01-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u06-l01","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u6-no-answer","setting":"Due amici sono preoccupati perché un’amica non risponde.","speakers":[{"name":"Max","voice":"a"},{"name":"Eva","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Max","text":"Sara hasn't answered my messages since Friday. That's not like her."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"She must have lost her phone again. She loses it every month."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"She can't have lost it. She posted a photo on social media this morning."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Then she might have been busy with work. She has a big project at the moment."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"Maybe. Or I might have said something that upset her. I made a joke about her new job."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Honestly, you shouldn't have joked about that. She's very nervous about it."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"You're right. I should have thought before I spoke. I'll call her tonight and apologize."}]},"question":"Perché Max è sicuro che Sara non abbia perso il telefono?","options":["Perché quella mattina ha pubblicato una foto sui social","Perché l’ha chiamata e lei ha risposto","Perché Eva l’ha vista","Perché Sara non perde mai niente"]},"answer":"Perché quella mattina ha pubblicato una foto sui social","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Max dice: “Sh