aims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"question":"Secondo Amy, come si diffonde la disinformazione?","options":["Senza nomi né fonti, solo con una grande promessa","Attraverso i giornali","Attraverso i medici","Con molti dati"]},"answer":"Senza nomi né fonti, solo con una grande promessa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Amy dice: “That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l01-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l01","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-viral","setting":"Due amiche parlano di un post diventato virale.","speakers":[{"name":"Zoe","voice":"a"},{"name":"Amy","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Have you seen this? A post says that drinking hot water every hour stops you from getting a cold."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"I've seen it. It went viral yesterday. My aunt has already shared it with the whole family."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Is it true, though? The post claims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"questi