 someone not to + verbo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-warn"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"She insisted ___ paying for dinner.","translation":"Ha insistito per pagare la cena.","options":["on","in","to","for"]},"answer":"on","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-insist"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una notizia di un giornale locale.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Che cosa aveva suggerito il post sui social?","options":["Che la chiusura del parco per costruire uffici era già decisa","Che il parco sarebbe diventato più grande","Che la sindaca si sarebbe dimessa","Che gli uffici sarebbero stati chiusi"]},"answer":"Che la chiusura del parco per costruire uffici era già decisa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La notizia dice: “A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una notizia di un giornale locale.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Che cosa ha avvertito e che cosa ha suggerito la sindaca?","options":["Di non credere a tutto quello che si legge su internet e di consultare il sito del comune","Di non andare al parco","Di cancellare il post","Di chiamare il comune"]},"answer":"Di non credere a tutto quello che si legge su internet e di consultare il sito del comune","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La notizia dice: “She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"He warned me not to touch the cables.","options":["He warned me not to touch the cables.","He told me to touch the cables.","He warned me not to cut the cables.","She warned me not to touch the cables."]},"answer":"He warned me not to touch the cables.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-warn"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["The","post","claims","that","doctors","recommend","it"],"translation":"Il post afferma che i medici lo consigliano."},"answer":"The post claims that doctors recommend it.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-claim"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"What did the doctor say? (ti ha avvertito di non mangiare zucchero)","translation":"Che cosa ha detto il medico?"},"answer":"He warned me not to eat sugar.","accepted_answers":["She warned me not to eat sugar.","He warned me not to eat any sugar.","The doctor warned me not to eat sugar."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-warn"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l02-e10","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l02","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Ha insistito per pagare la cena."},"answer":"She insisted on paying for dinner.","accepted_answers":["He insisted on paying for dinner.","She insisted on paying for the dinner.","He insisted on paying for the dinner."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-insist"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-rev1-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-rev1","position":1,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Le notizie false si diffondono più in fretta della verità."},"answer":"Fake news spreads faster than the truth.","accepted_answ