people"]},"answer":"audience","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Audience: il pubblico di un programma o di uno spettacolo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-audience"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The mayor ___ the rumor about the park.","translation":"La sindaca ha smentito la voce sul parco.","options":["denied","refused","accused","insisted"]},"answer":"denied","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Deny + sostantivo o -ing. Refuse va con to + verbo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-deny","eit-rumor"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una notizia di un giornale locale.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Che cosa ha ammesso la sindaca?","options":["Che il comune aveva parlato di nuovi uffici nella zona","Che avrebbero chiuso il parco","Che il post era vero","Che non conosceva il piano"]},"answer":"Che il comune aveva parlato di nuovi uffici nella zona","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La notizia dice: “She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una notizia di un giornale locale.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Che cosa ha fatto la persona che ha creato il post?","options":["Si è rifiutata di commentare","Ha chiesto scusa","Ha cancellato il post","Ha parlato con la sindaca"]},"answer":"Si è rifiutata di commentare","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La notizia finisce così: “The person who created the post has refused to comment”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u8-interview","setting":"Un’intervista televisiva a un politico.","speakers":[{"name":"Journalist","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hart","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Mr. Hart, a newspaper has accused your party of using public money for its campaign. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I completely deny that. Every dollar we spent was ours."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"But you admitted last week that the campaign had used government offices."},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I admitted using one office for one meeting. That's very different."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Will you publish the campaign accounts?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I refuse to answer questions based on rumors. I insist that we haven't done anything wrong."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe."}]},"question":"Che cosa lascia intendere la giornalista con il suo ultimo commento?","options":["Che molta gente non crederà a Hart","Che Hart ha ragione","Che l’intervista è finita bene","Che il pubblico non la stava guardando"]},"answer":"Che molta gente non crederà a Hart","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La giornalista dice: “Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The program has a large audience.","options":["The program has a large audience.","The program has a small audience.","The program had a large audience.","The concert has a large audience."]},"answer":"The program has a large audience.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-audience"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u08-l05-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u08-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","suggested","checking","the","official","website"],"translation":"Ha suggerito di consultare il sito ufficiale."},"answer":"She suggest