ld have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"Che cosa è successo a Paul all’università?","options":["L’ha lasciata al secondo anno","Si è laureato in ingegneria","Ha cambiato facoltà","Non l’ha mai cominciata"]},"answer":"L’ha lasciata al secondo anno","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paul dice: “I dropped out of university in my second year”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u09-l02-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u09-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I often look back on my school days.","options":["I often look back on my school days.","I never look back on my school days.","I often look back on my university days.","I often think about my school friends."]},"answer":"I often look back on my school days.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-look-back-on"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u09-l02-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u09-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["He","dropped","out","of","university","in","his","second","year"],"translation":"Ha abbandonato l’università al secondo anno."},"answer":"He dropped out of university in his second year.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-