 works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Secondo l’autore, che cosa l’ha aiutato a smettere di rimandare?","options":["L’autodisciplina: una routine che funziona anche nei giorni no","La motivazione","Un insegnante privato","Spegnere il telefono"]},"answer":"L’autodisciplina: una routine che funziona anche nei giorni no","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Scrive: “What finally helped was not motivation… What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u09-l04-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u09-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Un post di un blog su come smettere di rimandare.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Che cosa fa con ogni sessione di studio?","options":["La annota su un quaderno e gli piace vedere crescere la lista","La registra in video","La condivide sui social","La fa vedere a un amico"]},"answer":"La annota su un quaderno e gli piace vedere crescere la lista","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Scrive: “I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u09-l04-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u09-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Uno studente parla con una tutor dell’università.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"Perché Ivan pensa di lasciare l’università?","options":["Ha perso sei settimane per il lavoro e crede di non riuscire a mettersi in pari","Non gli piace il suo corso di laurea","Gli hanno offerto un lavoro migliore","È stato bocciato a un esame"]},"answer":"Ha perso sei settimane per il lavoro e crede di non riuscire a mettersi in pari","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan dice: “I’ve missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I’ll never catch up”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u09-