ll,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["eit-convincing"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"on the contrary","options":["on the contrary","take into account","what matters is","debate"]},"answer":"on the contrary","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-on-the-contrary"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2","position":7,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"It was difficult. ___, we finished on time.","translation":"È stato difficile. Ciononostante, abbiamo finito in tempo.","options":["Nevertheless","Moreover","Furthermore","As a result"]},"answer":"Nevertheless","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nevertheless introduce qualcosa che succede nonostante quanto detto prima.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-nevertheless"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2","position":8,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"È stato difficile. Ciononostante, abbiamo finito in tempo."},"answer":"It was difficult. Nevertheless, we finished on time.","accepted_answers":["It was hard. Nevertheless, we finished on time.","It was difficult. Nevertheless we finished on time."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-nevertheless"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2","position":9,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"We need to take the costs ___ account.","translation":"Dobbiamo tenere conto dei costi.","options":["into","in","on","to"]},"answer":"into","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-take-into-account"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-rev2","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"valido"},"answer":"valid","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-valid"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":1,"type":"translation_choice","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Che cosa significa “outweigh”?","payload":{"type":"translation_choice","word":"outweigh","options":["superare / pesare più di","tenere conto di","riassumendo / in sintesi","al contrario"]},"answer":"superare / pesare più di","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["eit-outweigh"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The benefits ___ the costs.","translation":"I benefici superano i costi.","options":["outweigh","outweighs","outweighed","sum up"]},"answer":"outweigh","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The benefits (plurale) outweigh.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-outweigh"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"To sum ___, I think the plan is a good idea.","translation":"Riassumendo, credo che il piano sia una buona idea.","options":["up","out","on","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-to-sum-up"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un articolo d’opinione sull’università gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"Con quale idea chiude l’autrice?","options":["Che l’università gratuita è un investimento in tutti noi, non un regalo","Che l’università dovrebbe costare meno","Che gli studenti devono pagare","Che lo Stato spende male"]},"answer":"Che l’università gratuita è un investimento in tutti noi, non un regalo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’articolo finisce così: “To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un articolo d’opinione sull’università gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"Che cosa mette in risalto la frase “It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance”?","options":["Che la cosa davvero cara è non istruire la gente","Che l’istruzione è molto cara","Che l’ignoranza non ha costi","Che lo Stato dovrebbe spendere meno"]},"answer":"Che la cosa davvero cara è non istruire la gente","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Con It is… that…, l’autrice mette a fuoco “the cost of ignorance”: la cosa preoccupante non è pagare l’istruzione, ma non averla.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-four-days","setting":"Alcuni colleghi discutono la proposta di lavorare quattro giorni a settimana.","speakers":[{"name":"Olivia","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ken","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"So, the four-day week. What worries me is the customers. Who answers the phone on Fridays?"},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"We'd take turns. The reason why other companies have done it is that people work better when they're rested."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"That may be true for some jobs. But we need to take into account that our clients expect us every day."},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"That's a valid point. So let's try it for three months and measure the results."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"OK, I find that convincing. All things considered, a trial is a good compromise."}]},"question":"Come finisce la discussione?","options":["Olivia si convince: provare per tre mesi è un buon compromesso","Non si mettono d’accordo","Ken ritira la proposta","Decidono di chiedere al capo"]},"answer":"Olivia si convince: provare per tre mesi è un buon compromesso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Olivia dice: “OK, I find that convincing. All things considered, a trial is a good compromise”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"All things considered, it was a good year.","options":["All things considered, it was a good year.","All things considered, it was a bad year.","All things considered, it will be a good year.","All in all, it was a good year."]},"answer":"All things considered, it was a good year.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-all-things-considered"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"So, should we buy the house? (riassumendo, pensi di sì)","translation":"Allora, compriamo la casa?"},"answer":"To sum up, I think we should.","accepted_answers":["To sum up, I think we should buy it.","To sum up, yes.","To sum up, I think we should buy the house."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-to-sum-up"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-l05-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u10-l05","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"I benefici superano i costi."},"answer":"The benefits outweigh the costs.","accepted_answers":["The advantages outweigh the costs."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-outweigh"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u10-listen-e01","lesson_id":"e