ame":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Come si è avvicinata la nonna al nonno?","options":["Di punto in bianco, è andata da lui e l’ha invitato a ballare","È stato lui a invitarla a ballare","Li ha presentati un amico","Si sono conosciuti per strada"]},"answer":"Di punto in bianco, è andata da lui e l’ha invitato a ballare","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Il nonno dice: “Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u11-l03-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u11-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Un nonno racconta alla nipote come ha conosciuto la nonna.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Che cosa ha rotto il ghiaccio quella sera?","options":["Che lei si è messa a ridere quando lui le ha pestato un piede","Una battuta del nonno","Una canzone","Che erano vicini di casa"]},"answer":"Che lei si è messa a ridere quando lui le ha pestato un piede","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Il nonno dice: “She laughed, and that broke the ice”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u11-l03-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u11-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Un nonno racconta alla nipote come ha conosciuto la nonna.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Che cosa è successo alla madre della nonna al matrimonio?"