diverso (had taken) → risultato presente (would be… now).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-would-have"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I ___ braver, I would have said yes.","translation":"Se fossi più coraggioso, avrei detto di sì.","options":["were","am","would be","will be"]},"answer":"were","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Misto: presente diverso (if I were) → risultato passato (would have said).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-would-have"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I'm having second ___ about the trip.","translation":"Sto avendo dei ripensamenti sul viaggio.","options":["thoughts","ideas","minds","feelings"]},"answer":"thoughts","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-have-second-thoughts"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Un’amica racconta a un’altra che deve decidere se trasferirsi per lavoro.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"Che cosa ricorda Rosa ad Alice?","options":["Che se avesse accettato il lavoro a Berlino, adesso parlerebbe tedesco","Che a Berlino le è andata male","Che a Berlino non le hanno mai offerto niente","Che i suoi genitori vivono a Lisbona"]},"answer":"Che se avesse accettato il lavoro a Berlino, adesso parlerebbe tedesco","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rosa dice: “If you had taken it, you’d be speaking German by now” (passato diverso → presente diverso).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Un’amica racconta a un’altra che deve decidere se trasferirsi per lavoro.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"Che cosa dice l’istinto ad Alice e perché ha dei dubbi?","options":["Di andare, ma ha dei dubbi per i genitori, che stanno invecchiando","Di restare, perché Lisbona non le piace","Di andare, perché lo stipendio è alto","Non ha nessuna intuizione"]},"answer":"Di andare, ma ha dei dubbi per i genitori, che stanno invecchiando","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Alice dice: “To go. But I’m having second thoughts because of my parents. They’re getting older”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-guide","document":"post","setting":"Un articolo su come prendere decisioni importanti.","title":"How to make a big decision","lines":["Big decisions are hard because there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security.","First, write down the pros and cons. Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly.","Second, ask yourself what is really at stake. Will this matter in five years? If not, do not spend weeks on it.","Third, listen to your gut feeling. Research suggests that our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of.","Finally, accept that no decision is perfect. If we had a crystal ball, we would never make mistakes. We do not, so we learn from them."]},"question":"Che cosa dice l’articolo sull’istinto?","options":["Che la prima reazione spesso contiene informazioni di cui non siamo consapevoli","Che non bisogna dargli retta","Che ci azzecca sempre","Che serve solo per le decisioni piccole"]},"answer":"Che la prima reazione spesso contiene informazioni di cui non siamo consapevoli","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’articolo dice: “our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"If I were braver, I would have said yes.","options":["If I were braver, I would have said yes.","If I were braver, I would say yes.","If I had been braver, I would have said yes.","If I were braver, I would have said no."]},"answer":"If I were braver, I would have said yes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-would-have"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["My","gut","feeling","says","I","should","go"],"translation":"Il mio istinto mi dice che devo andare."},"answer":"My gut feeling says I should go.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-gut-feeling"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why are you so tired today? (se non fossi andato a letto così tardi, non saresti stanco)","translation":"Perché sei così stanco oggi?"},"answer":"If I hadn't gone to bed so late, I wouldn't be tired.","accepted_answers":["If I had not gone to bed so late, I would not be tired.","If I hadn't gone to bed so late, I wouldn't be so tired.","If I'd gone to bed earlier, I wouldn't be tired."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-would-have"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l02-e10","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l02","