:"conflitto"},{"left":"resolve","right":"risolvere (un conflitto)"},{"left":"mediator","right":"mediatore / mediatrice"},{"left":"take sides","right":"schierarsi / prendere le parti di qualcuno"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-conflict","eit-resolve","eit-mediator","eit-take-sides"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Try to find some common ___.","translation":"Cerca di trovare dei punti in comune.","options":["ground","point","place","side"]},"answer":"ground","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-common-ground"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I don't want to take ___ in their argument.","translation":"Non voglio schierarmi nel loro litigio.","options":["sides","part","place","care"]},"answer":"sides","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-take-sides"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Un avviso di un servizio di mediazione tra vicini.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Che cosa fanno i mediatori, secondo l’avviso?","options":["Aiutano le due persone ad ascoltarsi e a trovare punti in comune","Decidono chi ha ragione","Chiamano la polizia","Fanno una multa"]},"answer":"Aiutano le due persone ad ascoltarsi e a trovare punti in comune","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’avviso dice: “Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una riunione tesa di un team prima di presentare un progetto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Qual è il conflitto tra design e vendite?","options":["Le vendite vogliono cambiare il design due giorni prima del lancio","Il design non vuole lavorare nel fine settimana","Le vendite hanno perso un cliente","Nessuno vuole fare il progetto"]},"answer":"Le vendite vogliono cambiare il design due giorni prima del lancio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dice: “The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We can help you resolve the conflict.","options":["We can help you resolve the conflict.","We can help you avoid the conflict.","We can help them resolve the conflict.","We could help you resolve the conflict."]},"answer":"We can help you resolve the conflict.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-resolve","eit-conflict"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["A","mediator","helps","both","sides","listen","to","each","other"],"translation":"Un mediatore aiuta le due parti ad ascoltarsi."},"answer":"A mediator helps both sides listen to each other.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["eit-mediator"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Who is right, your sister or your brother? (non vuoi schierarti)","translation":"Chi ha ragione, tua sorella o tuo fratello?"},"answer":"I don't want to take sides.","accepted_answers":["I do not want to take sides.","I don't want to take sides!","Sorry, I don't want to take sides."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-take-sides"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l03-e09","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l03","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Cerca di trovare dei punti in comune."},"answer":"Try to find some common ground.","accepted_answers":["Try to find common ground.","Try and find some common ground."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-common-ground"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e01","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"stand up for","right":"difendere (qualcuno o qualcosa)"},{"left":"back down","right":"cedere / fare marcia indietro"},{"left":"at stake","right":"in gioco"},{"left":"common ground","right":"punti in comune"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["eit-stand-up-for","eit-back-down","eit-at-stake","eit-common-ground"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e02","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I have to stand up ___ my team.","translation":"Devo difendere il mio team.","options":["for","to","with","on"]},"answer":"for","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-stand-up-for"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Neither side wanted to back ___.","translation":"Nessuna delle due parti voleva cedere.","options":["down","up","out","off"]},"answer":"down","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-back-down"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una riunione tesa di un team prima di presentare un progetto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Perché Ines insiste con le modifiche?","options":["Perché c’è in gioco un cliente importante","Perché il design non le piace","Perché gliel’ha chiesto il capo","Perché Leo lavora poco"]},"answer":"Perché c’è in gioco un cliente importante","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ines dice: “We’re only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una riunione tesa di un team prima di presentare un progetto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Quale soluzione propone la responsabile?","options":["Nessuna parte cede del tutto: un’unica lista di modifiche essenziali e il team di Leo decide che cosa è possibile","Annullare il lancio","Fare tutte le modifiche delle vendite","Che decida Leo da solo"]},"answer":"Nessuna parte cede del tutto: un’unica lista di modifiche essenziali e il team di Leo decide che cosa è possibile","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La responsabile dice: “Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una riunione tesa di un team prima di presentare un progetto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Perché Leo difende il suo team?","options":["Perché hanno lavorato tutti i fine settimana del mese","Perché il design è perfetto","Perché non conoscono il cliente","Perché Ines gli sta antipatica"]},"answer":"Perché hanno lavorato tutti i fine settimana del mese","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dice: “I have to stand up for my team. They’ve worked every weekend this month”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e07","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"A big client is at stake.","options":["A big client is at stake.","A big client is on the way.","A big project is at stake.","A big client was at stake."]},"answer":"A big client is at stake.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-at-stake"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l04-e08","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l04","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Will you change your mind? (no, non farai marcia indietro)","translation":"Cambierai idea?"},"answer":"No, I won't back down.","accepted_answers"