o, ma è anche riservato.","options":["is","it is","does","be"]},"answer":"is","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Not only + ausiliare + soggetto: Not only is the service…","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-not-only"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l05-e03","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l05","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Under no circumstances ___ you open this door.","translation":"In nessun caso dovresti aprire questa porta.","options":["should","you should","do","are"]},"answer":"should","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Under no circumstances + ausiliare + soggetto.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-under-no-circumstances"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l05-e04","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l05","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"___ you need help, please call reception.","translation":"Se ha bisogno di aiuto, chiami la reception.","options":["Should","Would","Do","Unless"]},"answer":"Should","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Should you need… = If you need… (formale).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["eit-should-you"]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l05-e05","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Un avviso di un servizio di mediazione tra vicini.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Quali due vantaggi del servizio mette in evidenza l’avviso?","options":["Che è gratuito e riservato","Che è veloce ed economico","Che è obbligatorio e gratuito","Che funziona nel fine settimana"]},"answer":"Che è gratuito e riservato","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’avviso dice: “Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"eit-b2-u12-l05-e06","lesson_id":"eit-b2-u12-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Un avviso di un servizio di mediazione tra vicini.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Che cosa promette il servizio sulle tue informazioni?","options":["Che non le condividerà mai con l’altra persona senza il tuo permesso","Che le pubblica nel centro civico","Che le condivide con la polizia","Che le cancella dopo una settimana"]},"answer":"Che non le condividerà mai con l’altra persona senza il tuo permesso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’avviso dice: “Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"i