t_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Sorry, I didn't ___ to wake you up.","translation":"Scusa, non volevo svegliarti.","options":["mean","want","try","think"]},"answer":"mean","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Didn’t mean to + verbo: non era tua intenzione farlo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.sqggnn91u1s77c","content_hash":"v1:4cada42dbc0b4450a7b2fa99ee293e19ff4fc60313541428ba5fa281c7679cec","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I thought he was angry, but ___ he was just tired.","translation":"Pensavo che fosse arrabbiato, ma in realtà era solo stanco.","options":["actually","probably","finally","eventually"]},"answer":"actually","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Actually = in realtà (corregge quello che pensavi). Non è «attualmente», che in inglese è currently.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.volk3n3x2kx17i","content_hash":"v1:35c2f78e25d4fd67f56408bef1c59c5a5186623eb64158597ecdd7e6946a4a33","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u1-email-tone","setting":"Due colleghi parlano di un’email che è stata presa male.","speakers":[{"name":"Nina","voice":"a"},{"name":"Sam","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Can I ask you something? Did my email this morning seem rude to you?"},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Honestly? It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"Perché l’email di Nina è sembrata maleducata?","options":["Perché era molto breve, senza saluto né ringraziamento","Perché aveva degli errori","Perché l’ha mandata a tutti","Perché era tutta in maiuscolo"]},"answer":"Perché era molto breve, senza saluto né ringraziamento","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sam dice: “It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.h27qqs22yz9lwh","content_hash":"v1:978f034151e3bcb47185de482f1f4471f4b5fd325fde87b73759ade863dba182","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u1-email-tone","setting":"Due colleghi parlano di un’email che è stata presa male.","speakers":[{"name":"Nina","voice":"a"},{"name":"Sam","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Can I ask you something? Did my email this morning seem rude to you?"},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Honestly? It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"Che cosa pensa Sam che convenga fare?","options":["Chiamare Mark, perché il tono non sempre arriva per iscritto","Mandare un’altra email a Mark","Non dire niente","Parlare con il capo"]},"answer":"Chiamare Mark, perché il tono non sempre arriva per iscritto","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sam dice: “A call is better than another email. Tone doesn’t always get across in writing”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.17c5iv61hhusbp","content_hash":"v1:edae254dce6ceb664e0ea6101cef3df267edfaad53667858db797c7181e99ec8","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","options":["It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","It was an argument, not a misunderstanding.","It wasn't an accident, just a misunderstanding.","It wasn't an argument, just a mistake."]},"answer":"It wasn't an argument, just a misunderstanding.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.rc9xnhdmx6jnut","content_hash":"v1:bf150797bb7b4ffc8c3b11409cf8c497c26c657b84646101035235418fee204f","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","did","not","mean","to","sound","angry"],"translation":"Non volevo sembrare arrabbiato."},"answer":"I did not mean to sound angry.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":false},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.h97n3ka0lmogln","content_hash":"v1:bac1a6ef36f14b402ae8a9f2b04bffd233d835451d7e025cf3c5599a50826fb1","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why did you say that? (non volevi essere maleducato)","translation":"Perché l’hai detto?"},"answer":"I didn't mean to be rude.","accepted_answers":["I did not mean to be rude.","Sorry, I didn't mean to be rude.","I didn't mean to sound rude."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.mcoyfd0m1gwdbb","content_hash":"v1:4a3197f12cf64f09a89f625c087f626e630877a933b4cdbfcd1c5e1bda6462d2","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Non mi è piaciuto il tono del suo messaggio."},"answer":"I didn't like the tone of his message.","accepted_answers":["I did not like the tone of his message.","I didn't like the tone of her message.","I did not like the tone of her message."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.t5w2v2tyjekzfj","content_hash":"v1:7955ed9bfc207a079458e8f44427962d2aa6c001fbea140ccfdc18bf2e2bbaad","prompt_es":"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"hint","right":"frecciatina / indizio"},{"left":"imply","right":"insinuare / lasciar intendere"},{"left":"sarcastic","right":"sarcastico"},{"left":"apparently","right":"a quanto pare / pare che"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"pair_set","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.2415vvwnr78o2c","content_hash":"v1:3403f777bf51dec8d48a5971b89bfdb323895b974f7ed5caad29479816fd6d16","prompt_es":"Che cosa mostra l’immagine?","payload":{"type":"image_choice","emoji":"🙄","options":["sarcastic","polite","honest","friendly"]},"answer":"sarcastic","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.ojmft710jvk3wu","content_hash":"v1:57260b6b773f9884873d555278c62fa9960df