d that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"Come mostrano oggi i giovani che tengono alla famiglia, secondo la sociologa?","options":["In un altro modo, per esempio con una videochiamata invece di un pranzo","Non lo mostrano più","Vivendo con i genitori","Andando in chiesa"]},"answer":"In un altro modo, per esempio con una videochiamata invece di un pranzo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice: “They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.ecf59lcdlia6jt","content_hash":"v1:b58a14ac90c2e19dbe2abff93c7922ceb260c32b0107a31776c02951f5fe0221","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u3-market","document":"notice","setting":"Un avviso del comune sul vecchio mercato.","title":"Our market is changing","lines":["The old market is being renovated and will be closed until the end of May.","The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month.","The market has been used by local families for more than a hundred years. It is believed to be the oldest building in the 