voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"We go now to Paula, who is in the south, where there hasn't been any real rain for eight months."},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Thanks. This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"How are farmers dealing with it?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"With great difficulty. Even though they have reduced their water use, many have lost half of their crops. And there is now a water shortage in three towns."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is this connected to global warming?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Scientists say yes. Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods. Extreme weather, in both directions, is a direct consequence of a warmer planet."}]},"question":"Perché i fiumi sono ancora bassi?","options":["Perché i temporali della settimana scorsa non sono bastati dopo otto mesi senza pioggia","Perché gli agricoltori usano troppa acqua","Perché ci sono state alluvioni","Perché hanno chiuso una diga"]},"answer":"Perché i temporali della settimana scorsa non sono bastati dopo otto mesi senza pioggia","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula dice: “This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.u0408tqz110cll","content_hash":"v1:2b1f7da54c3dc7c3c8aeeb4cf37b8d10ed3bd075538ac8785443c7437b20e192","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u7-drought","setting":"Un servizio radiofonico sulla siccità in una regione agricola.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Paula","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"We go now to Paula, who is in the south, where there hasn't been any real r