2fc557d0ee6ab2c73a12e845988bbe01ddd8671e","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"___ it rains, the game will go ahead.","translation":"Anche se piove, la partita si giocherà.","options":["Even if","Despite","Whereas","In spite of"]},"answer":"Even if","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.jt16u3lc9ett9w","content_hash":"v1:a7fd1f9fc4ea367cd9fef665cef03afb9422d1d05da9bb8a74b1bb1c50575403","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Due studenti discutono se una persona può aiutare il pianeta.","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"That's great, but honestly, it won't change anything. Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I don't agree. Big changes always start with small groups of people."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"Maybe. But we need to tackle the real causes: coal, oil, and the way we produce food."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"Sure, but those things change when people demand something different."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"OK, that's a fair point. So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there."}]},"question":"Che cosa fa Noah nonostante il prezzo?","options":["Va in treno a trovare la sua famiglia invece di prendere l’aereo","Prende meno l’aereo in vacanza","Va all’università in bici","Ha smesso di mangiare carne"]},"answer":"Va in treno a trovare la sua famiglia invece di prendere l’aereo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Noah dice: “I’ve stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.73y3fgtwv7dh7e","content_hash":"v1:6ccf412adb3103a8cc36d68a5e4cf1d09eb4af3efcfb521305b4722a92429c0d","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Due studenti discutono se una persona può aiutare il pianeta.","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"That's great, but honestly, it won't change anything. Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I don't agree. Big changes always start with small groups of people."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"Maybe. But we need to tackle the real causes: coal, oil, and the way we produce food."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"Sure, but those things change when people demand something different."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"OK, that's a fair point. So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there."}]},"question":"Che cosa vuol dire Mia con “Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference”?","options":["Che anche se lo facessero tutti, l’effetto sarebbe molto piccolo","Che nessuno smetterà di prendere l’aereo","Che volare non inquina","Che la città è molto piccola"]},"answer":"Che anche se lo facessero tutti, l’effetto sarebbe molto piccolo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Even if: anche nel caso in cui tutti smettessero di volare, il risultato (una differenza minima) non cambierebbe.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.fmo26y8wy8jskl","content_hash":"v