en though I was tired, I finished the report.","Because I was tired, I finished the report.","Even though I was tired, I started the report.","Even though I was busy, I finished the report."]},"answer":"Even though I was tired, I finished the report.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.ucrjtms6gnbk4q","content_hash":"v1:56517d19737a31e93c868954022cac97af7dd4d43a2813803facc51160a59a91","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Did you go to the beach? (sì, nonostante il freddo)","translation":"Siete andati al mare?"},"answer":"Yes, despite the cold.","accepted_answers":["Yes, in spite of the cold.","Yes, we went despite the cold.","Yes, even though it was cold."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.si8czqft87xznb","content_hash":"v1:117c0d6f70a6b371c01c747f34c397b6a8c7efbb831cc218e5db1df3d22a1629","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Nonostante la pioggia, siamo usciti a fare una passeggiata."},"answer":"Despite the rain, we went for a walk.","accepted_answers":["In spite of the rain, we went for a walk.","Despite the rain we went for a walk.","We went for a walk despite the rain."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.3hbxobd3yh45yg","content_hash":"v1:edbac35ae195557f0b3d31af05eceff97ec9d6aed23a541a0ab2bdcd7b298513","prompt_es":"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"renewable","