at to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Per chi ha una “mentalità di crescita”, che cos’è un errore?","options":["Un’informazione che mostra che cosa esercitare dopo","Un fallimento","Un motivo per arrendersi","Qualcosa da nascondere"]},"answer":"Un’informazione che mostra che cosa esercitare dopo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’articolo dice: “a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.htw1qqogt98frq","content_hash":"v1:bb3acacba328024c29f0f161f39169eb075b679f397f705f70f3644156d00cfc","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un articolo divulgativo sulla mentalità di crescita.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Che cosa aiuta gli studenti a rimanere motivati più a lungo?","options":["Vedere i propri progressi","Prendere bei voti","Avere talento","Studiare da soli"]},"answer":"Vedere i propri progressi","accepted_answer