rompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I missed two classes, so I need to catch ___.","translation":"Ho perso due lezioni, quindi devo mettermi in pari.","options":["up","on","out","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.ysiypiwitxc1m4","content_hash":"v1:6b28858e627440cf0db89fdeb3044e8723cb653393c7c2b8fbb549910156c107","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Un post di un blog su come smettere di rimandare.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Secondo l’autore, che cosa l’ha aiutato a smettere di rimandare?","options":["L’autodisciplina: una routine che funziona anche nei giorni no","La motivazione","Un insegnante privato","Spegnere il telefono"]},"answer":"L’autodisciplina: una routine che funziona anche nei giorni no","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Scrive: “What finally helped was not motivation… What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.e