"prompt_es":"Abbina ogni parola al suo significato","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"debate","right":"dibattito"},{"left":"moreover","right":"inoltre (formale)"},{"left":"furthermore","right":"per di più / in aggiunta"},{"left":"as a result","right":"di conseguenza / per questo"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"pair_set","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.n3axmknhyr6cjb","content_hash":"v1:40e0ad209e2e1b20d7e2705dd79dc56208a52b49ee120c7f7c96c3da3bfb4fab","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The plan is cheap. ___, it is easy to start.","translation":"Il piano è economico. Inoltre, è facile da avviare.","options":["Moreover","However","Although","Unless"]},"answer":"Moreover","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Moreover aggiunge una ragione a favore; however segna un contrasto.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.fdsorwsncep93k","content_hash":"v1:ada2acf74adbf1f1b3a1a6b46512860b53611f75eb67a729b44b07b8c1689c39","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"It rained all week. As a ___, the match was canceled.","translation":"Ha piovuto tutta la settimana. Di conseguenza, la partita è stata annullata.","options":["result","reason","end","point"]},"answer":"result","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.pdq6zljivu16te","content_hash":"v1:3b1b5871f7d4995c44a3bb834068dd24d7983de911ba7925533877ecf5acd1db","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Un dibattito a scuola: bisogna vietare i telefoni in classe?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"Quali ragioni dà Lucas per vietare i telefoni?","options":["Distraggono e facilitano il bullismo, che continua dopo la scuola","Sono cari","Si rompono facilmente","I professori non li sanno usare"]},"answer":"Distraggono e facilitano il bullismo, che continua dopo la scuola","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Lucas dice: “Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.d3ae3emd5syl2n","content_hash":"v1:37a78c35014f8e678c5d7669b507ebc97880ddd2a09cdddcb61415100f7be6dc","prompt_es":"Ascolta e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Un dibattito a scuola: bisogna vietare i telefoni in classe?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"Quale conseguenza menziona Lucas?","options":["Molti studenti si sentono ansiosi tutto il giorno","Gli studenti prendono brutti voti","I genitori si lamentano","La scuola spende di più"]},"answer":"Molti studenti si sentono ansiosi tutto il giorno","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Lucas dice: “As a result, many students feel anxious all day”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.hcrrl0cj28v9b7","content_hash":"v1:c8fefe2fdeb5b527e5e951d4f61272c0f8369f24ebfaf3ea83bb00628d348bc9","prompt_es":"Leggi e rispondi","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"eit.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un articolo d’opinione sull’università gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"Quale secondo argomento aggiunge l’autrice con furthermore?","options":["Che l’istruzione gratuita dà agli studenti poveri le stesse opportunità","Che i laureati pagano meno tasse","Che le università costano poco","Che i ricchi non dovrebbero studiare"]},"answer":"Che l’istruzione gratuita dà agli studenti poveri le stesse opportunità","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’articolo dice: “Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.heg7zadehsq0a3","content_hash":"v1:50157cd09638331f23935e88b5ad579dc901971945624d263ccc7300ec1b6b01","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We had a debate about social media.","options":["We had a debate about social media.","We had a debate about the news.","We have a debate about social media.","They had a debate about social media."]},"answer":"We had a debate about social media.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.mbpsnkgyqx6yoc","content_hash":"v1:8f2c9568a9c4371569442e623784f3226c8b6f2fa974b8963f8c244e9d7bfb22","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Furthermore","free","education","gives","everyone","the","same","chances"],"translation":"Per di più, l’istruzione gratuita dà a tutti le stesse opportunità."},"answer":"Furthermore free education gives everyone the same chances.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":false},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.uopno3hhbn3ujk","content_hash":"v1:76bcc1632bce78a76b91128d78e7c416ae5d4a4801212eca2b92ed74719f436d","prompt_es":"Rispondi in inglese","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"The match was canceled. Why? (ha piovuto tutta la settimana; di conseguenza, è stata annullata)","translation":"La partita è stata annullata. Perché?"},"answer":"It rained all week. As a result, it was canceled.","accepted_answers":["It rained all week. As a result, the match was canceled.","It rained all week and as a result it was canceled.","It rained all week, as a result it was canceled."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.b4sgjy4rxecgsd","content_hash":"v1:327af78b3cf76728c40505467489a5769154768e782bce6e06b1ffc088087246","prompt_es":"Traduci in inglese","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Il piano è economico. Inoltre, è facile da avviare."},"answer":"The plan is cheap. Moreover, it is easy to start.","accepted_answers":["The plan is cheap. Moreover, it's easy to start.","The plan is cheap. Furthermore, it is easy to start.","The plan is cheap. Moreover it is easy to start."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.utlwubl5b77xhd","content_hash":"v1:ad5704b6edde1d903174e1710c92d2f3bcfc5fdc7a32c7fb932580f60f519aee","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence"