},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Qual è il conflitto tra design e vendite?","options":["Le vendite vogliono cambiare il design due giorni prima del lancio","Il design non vuole lavorare nel fine settimana","Le vendite hanno perso un cliente","Nessuno vuole fare il progetto"]},"answer":"Le vendite vogliono cambiare il design due giorni prima del lancio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dice: “The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.7yad91u4t1uzbv","content_hash":"v1:7c690dfd3b6c573a054048d79369dc4375dc2f1ef35f91e4dcf1543520d4e030","prompt_es":"Ascolta e scegli quello che senti","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We can help you resolve the conflict.","options":["We can help you resolve the conflict.","We can help you avoid the conflict.","We can help them resolve the conflict.","We could help you resolve the conflict."]},"answer":"We can help you resolve the conflict.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.y9jkvr1s03w4l1","content_hash":"v1:311f65c2196a77c8472a1a408df7c97ae2d9f86f78e7ea81850aad5076a026ad","prompt_es":"Metti le parole in ordine","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["A","mediator","helps","both","sides","listen","to","each","other"],"translation":"Un mediatore aiuta le due parti ad ascoltarsi."},"answer":"A mediator helps both sides listen to each other.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":false},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"eit.ex.rqpkdu1